OL,3,GNEWSABanks refund victims of Legacy
OL,4,Afake funeral plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo banks have agreed to refund victims
OL,7,Fof disgraced funeral director Robert
OL,8,FBush, who defrauded customers by
OL,9,Fselling fake funeral plans, according
OL,10,Fto an MP.
OL,12,FPolice discovered 35 bodies and more
OL,13,Fthan 100 sets of ashes at Legacy
OL,14,FIndependent Funeral Directors in Hull
OL,15,Fin March 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
