OL,3,GNEWSABanks refund victims of Legacy
OL,4,Afake funeral plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBush, who admitted denying 30 people a
OL,7,Fdecent and proper burial, giving
OL,8,Ffamilies the wrong ashes and selling
OL,9,Ffake funeral plans, was jailed for 20
OL,10,Fyears at Hull Crown Court in July. The
OL,11,Fcourt heard he defrauded nearly 200
OL,12,Ffamilies out of #562,117.
OL,14,FHull West and Haltemprice MP Emma
OL,15,FHardy, who has been leading calls for
OL,16,Fbanks to reimburse victims, said the
OL,17,Flost money was something many people
OL,18,Fcould not afford.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
